From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jaime Dias <jaimejosediasnt@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 18:58:09 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 02/22] m68k-all: support an m68k that is not an Amiga

The shared m68k layer assumed Amiga hardware in places where the
assumption is really about the CPU or about having a chipset at all:
cache maintenance, dispatch, signalling, task switch and wait.

Adds preserveall.S and preserveall_install.c, which the exec mmakefile
now builds.
---
